# data / tape / DBs — never commit
data/
# monitor raw tape stays VPS-local (2026-08-24): ws_depth deltas would roughly DOUBLE the
# repo's ~50MB/day git tape budget, and monitor_markets re-derives hourly from the public
# API. Both are queryable via data/monitor.db (scripts/monitor_ingest.py); retention is
# config/monitor.yaml `retention:`.
tape/ws_depth/
tape/monitor_markets/
tape/monitor_poll/
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.parquet

